// Build settings for the app and the widget. The phone remote's token
// (REMOTE_TOKEN on the Convex deployment, convex/roles.ts) comes from
// Secrets.xcconfig, which git ignores: copy Secrets.example.xcconfig to
// Secrets.xcconfig and paste the token in. It reaches the code through each
// target's Info.plist (LightsRemoteToken) and Config.remoteToken.
LIGHTS_REMOTE_TOKEN =
#include? "Secrets.xcconfig"
